{"id":3689,"date":"2017-05-12T22:53:19","date_gmt":"2017-05-13T02:53:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3689"},"modified":"2017-05-12T22:56:39","modified_gmt":"2017-05-13T02:56:39","slug":"fishermans-paradise","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/05\/12\/fishermans-paradise\/","title":{"rendered":"Fisherman&#8217;s Paradise at Pere Marquette"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Since we&#8217;ve been here just a few days in the &#8220;up north&#8221; area of Michigan, we&#8217;ve been able to do a little exploring. \u00a0We arrived at Pere Marquette Oaks RV Park on Sunday the 7th of May and our official work start date is not until the 15th.<\/p>\n<p>Right after we arrived Sunday night, we noticed a leak in the kitchen sink area. \u00a0First thing Monday, a trip to the local ACE Hardware in Baldwin. \u00a0WOW! \u00a0What a store.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3691\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3691\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-12-12.58.19.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-3691\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-12-12.58.19-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-12-12.58.19-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-12-12.58.19-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-12-12.58.19-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-12-12.58.19.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3691\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Baldwin ACE Hardware<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Large store with ample supply of what seemed to be anything anyone might need or want without the need to drive to Big Rapids or Ludington for one of the big box stores.<\/p>\n<p>Just a small length of plastic pipe strap fixed the problem in a jiffy. The slip joint on the &#8220;p&#8221; trap had come loose from the jiggling as we travel down the road.<\/p>\n<p>While we were in town we decided to check out some of the Pere Marquette River boat launch sites AND OF COURSE one of the local restaurants for a late morning breakfast.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3689 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.14.04.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.14.04.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3695\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.14.04.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.14.04-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.14.04-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.14.04-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3695'>\n\t\t\t\tThe Village Cafe\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.56.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.56.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3693\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.56.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.56-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.56-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.56-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3693'>\n\t\t\t\tThis is JUST ONE of Kathy&#8217;s Buttermilk Pancakes!\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.50.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.50.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3692\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.50.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.50-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.50-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.52.50-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3692'>\n\t\t\t\tMy perfectly prepared bacon\/cheese\/mushroom\/potato omelette\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>After breakfast we walked across the street to see the famous JONES Ice Cream Shop. \u00a0They have been making their private recipe ice cream in the back room for 75 years. \u00a0The parlor&#8217;s walls are lined with hundreds of black and white photos showing Lake County history from the mid 1800&#8217;s forward. \u00a0Take a look at the photos below and see the old time ice cream parlor chairs and stools at the counter.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-2' class='gallery galleryid-3689 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-large'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.35.22.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.35.22-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-2-3696\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.35.22-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.35.22-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.35.22-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-11.35.22.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-2-3696'>\n\t\t\t\tJones Ice Cream Parlor\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.29.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.29-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.29-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.29-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.29-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.29.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.49.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.49-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.49-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.49-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.49-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-08-12.12.49.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" style=\"border: none;\" src=\"\/\/rcm-na.amazon-adsystem.com\/e\/cm?o=1&amp;p=48&amp;l=ur1&amp;category=kitchen&amp;banner=1BD9MBXK5KWFV9SX7202&amp;f=ifr&amp;linkID=07a0c193891d1a299f9d12c4af45ad6a&amp;t=herbnkathy-20&amp;tracking_id=herbnkathy-20\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>After breakfast we decided we wanted to look around town a bit check out the river that this area is so famous for. \u00a0I&#8217;ve put together a video (below) showing some of the different walk-in sites and boat launch sites to the river and some of the lakes in the nearby area.<\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 240px;\" src=\"\/\/ws-na.amazon-adsystem.com\/widgets\/q?ServiceVersion=20070822&amp;OneJS=1&amp;Operation=GetAdHtml&amp;MarketPlace=US&amp;source=ac&amp;ref=tf_til&amp;ad_type=product_link&amp;tracking_id=herbnkathy-20&amp;marketplace=amazon&amp;region=US&amp;placement=B00A7EXF4C&amp;asins=B00A7EXF4C&amp;linkId=f9e0552ce0a82911a86dd4f1726aae73&amp;show_border=true&amp;link_opens_in_new_window=false&amp;price_color=333333&amp;title_color=0066c0&amp;bg_color=efedf7\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\"><br \/>\n<\/iframe><\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/-uFXhffrO3A\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>So far, we are impressed by the beauty of the water and the quiet that abounds. \u00a0It&#8217;s so peaceful and calming. \u00a0Our next post will be a little about the park we&#8217;re living at for the summer. \u00a0Stay tuned for more.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Since we&#8217;ve been here just a few days in the &#8220;up north&#8221; area of Michigan, we&#8217;ve been able to do a little exploring. \u00a0We arrived at Pere Marquette Oaks RV Park on Sunday the 7th of May and our official work start date is not until the 15th. Right after we arrived Sunday night, we &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/05\/12\/fishermans-paradise\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Fisherman&#8217;s Paradise at Pere Marquette<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,264,19546,554707329,30025],"tags":[554707354,554707358,554707250,554707356,11110,554707355,554707308,554707359,554707357],"class_list":["post-3689","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-learning","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","category-working","tag-baldwin","tag-brown-trout","tag-fishing","tag-ludington","tag-michigan","tag-pere-marquette","tag-river","tag-steelhead","tag-trout"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3689","targetHints":{"allow